                    <p class="small text-muted mb-3" style="font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.5;">
                        Aplikasi dirancang ultra-ringan, hemat memori, dan stabil di perangkat spek rendah sekalipun. Data tersinkronisasi 100% secara real-time ke basis data PostgreSQL.
                    </p>

                    <div class="d-grid gap-2 mb-3">
                        <a href="/downloads/SiBangku-Universal-App.apk" download="SiBangku-@(ProvisionedSuccessModal.TenantCode.ToLowerInvariant()).apk" class="ms-btn ms-btn-outline d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between p-3 text-decoration-none">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                                <i class="bi bi-android2 fs-3 text-success"></i>
                                <div class="text-start">
                                    <div class="fw-bold" style="color: var(--ms-text-main);">Paket APK Android (.apk)</div>
                                    <small class="text-muted font-mono" style="font-size: 0.72rem;">Untuk HP / Tablet Android staf & kasir (Ringan & hemat RAM)</small>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <span class="ms-badge ms-badge-primary"><i class="bi bi-download me-1"></i> Unduh APK</span>
                        </a>

                        <a href="/downloads/SiBangku-Desktop-App.exe" download="SiBangku-Desktop-@(ProvisionedSuccessModal.TenantCode.ToLowerInvariant()).exe" class="ms-btn ms-btn-outline d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between p-3 text-decoration-none">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                                <i class="bi bi-windows fs-3 text-primary"></i>
                                <div class="text-start">
                                    <div class="fw-bold" style="color: var(--ms-text-main);">Paket Desktop Windows (.exe)</div>
                                    <small class="text-muted font-mono" style="font-size: 0.72rem;">Launcher native super cepat (~4 KB, jalan mulus di PC spek rendah)</small>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <span class="ms-badge ms-badge-primary"><i class="bi bi-download me-1"></i> Unduh EXE</span>
                        </a>

                        <a href="/downloads/SiBangku-Desktop-Launcher.bat" download="SiBangku-Launcher-@(ProvisionedSuccessModal.TenantCode.ToLowerInvariant()).bat" class="ms-btn ms-btn-outline d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between p-2.5 text-decoration-none">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                                <i class="bi bi-terminal fs-4 text-warning"></i>
                                <div class="text-start">
                                    <div class="fw-semibold small" style="color: var(--ms-text-main);">Desktop Script Launcher (.bat)</div>
                                    <small class="text-muted font-mono" style="font-size: 0.7rem;">Skrip batch alternatif untuk PC POS kasir lama</small>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <span class="ms-badge ms-badge-secondary"><i class="bi bi-download me-1"></i> Unduh BAT</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>

                    <div class="p-2.5 rounded text-center small font-mono" style="background: rgba(184, 142, 45, 0.08); border: 1px solid var(--ms-border); color: var(--ms-text-muted); font-size: 0.74rem;">
                        <i class="bi bi-shield-check text-success me-1"></i> PWA Terpasang • Kompatibel Spek Rendah • Sinkronisasi PostgreSQL Real-Time
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="ms-modal-footer">
                    <button type="button" class="ms-btn ms-btn-secondary" @onclick="() => ProvisionedSuccessModal = null">Selesai</button>
                    <a href="/tenant-admin" target="_blank" class="ms-btn ms-btn-primary">
                        <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right me-1"></i> Buka Portal Mitra
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
